+- `structlog.processors.ExceptionRenderer` (and therefore `structlog.processors.format_exc_info` and `structlog.processors.dict_tracebacks`) no longer adds an `exception` key if there is no exception to render, e.g. when `exception()` is called outside of an exception handler.
